# A&S Wholesalers — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the real values in Vercel for production.

# GoHighLevel inbound webhook URL for enquiries.
# When set, POST /api/enquiry forwards every enquiry to GHL.
# When unset (the demo default), the endpoint validates and confirms the enquiry
# without forwarding — no fake mail backend. Wiring GHL later is this one variable.
GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
